# Machine-specific Drive overrides. Copy to .drive-map.local at the ROOT of your brain
# (beside spaces/), keep it gitignored, and edit only the exceptional nodes.
# Format: <node path>|<absolute target on THIS machine>
#
# The node path is relative to spaces/ — 'french', not 'spaces/french'. That is also how
# the convention root maps, so Drive never mirrors the repo's own container folder.
#
# Portable mappings belong in committed `drive-map` as paths relative to the common cloud
# root. Nodes listed here override that file entirely — use this for a pre-existing folder,
# a separately-shared folder, or a different Google account on this machine.
#
# french|/path/to/cloud-storage/French class
# work/team|/path/to/work-drive/Team
